# Tech Stack

- **Framework:** React / Next.js (App Router preferred)
- **Data fetching:** SWR — fetchers in `shared/api/`
- **Styling:** SASS Modules + BEM
- **Icons:** SVG via `vite-plugin-svgr` with `?react` suffix — never inline SVG in TSX

## Project structure

```
src/
  shared/
    components/   # Reusable UI
    hooks/
    api/          # SWR fetchers
    types/
    constants/
```

Each component in its own folder: `index.tsx`, `index.module.scss`, optional `types.ts` / `constants.ts`.
